overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◈</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Art</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Music &#38; sound：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">♫</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Music &amp; sound</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Voice：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◉</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Voice</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Writing：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✎</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Writing</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile is-used" title="Translation：AI use disclosed"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">文</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Translation</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Marketing：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Marketing</span> </span> </div> <div class="ai-overview-foot"><span><i class="ai-key used"></i>Reported use</span><span><i class="ai-key"></i>Unmarked does not mean AI-free</span><span class="ai-overview-arrow">View evidence ↗</span></div> </a> <div class="ai-chips"> <span class="chip used">Art</span><span class="chip used">Translation</span>  </div> <div class="actions"> <a class="btn primary" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3401570/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam store ↗</a> <button class="btn" id="saveBtn" type="button" title="Saved in this browser only">☆ Save</button> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn" type="button">Share</button> </div> <dl class="facts"> <div><dt>Steam App ID</dt><dd><code>3401570</code><button class="copy" id="copyId" type="button">Copy</button></dd></div> <div><dt>Developer</dt><dd>Northern Studio LLC</dd></div> <div><dt>Publisher</dt><dd>Northern Studio LLC</dd></div> <div><dt>Release date</dt><dd>Oct 25, 2026</dd></div> <div><dt>Price</dt><dd>¥ 45.45</dd></div> <div><dt>Platforms</dt><dd>Windows</dd></div> <div><dt>Genres</dt><dd>Action / Indie / RPG</dd></div> <div><dt>Tags</dt><dd>单人、Steam 成就、自定义音量控制、无需应对快速反应事件、DUALSHOCK 控制器支持、DUALSHOCK 控制器支持、部分支持控制器、Steam 云、家庭共享</dd></div>   <div><dt>Languages</dt><dd class="clamp">英语 * , 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 俄语, 日语, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 法语, 德语, 韩语 * 具有完全音频支持的语言</dd></div> <div><dt>Website</dt><dd><a href="https://abyssring.netlify.app/english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">abyssring.netlify.app ↗</a></dd></div>  </dl> </aside> </section> <nav class="section-nav" aria-label="On this page"> <a href="#ai">AI use</a> <a href="#evidence">Evidence</a> <a href="#steam">Steam data</a> <a href="#developer">Developer</a> <a href="#sources">Sources &amp; corrections</a> </nav> <section class="section" id="ai"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">AI USE</div><h2>Eight areas, separate answers</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">2 / 8 areas with reported AI use</div> </div> <div class="status-note tone-amber"> <strong>Official AI disclosure</strong><span>The developer has disclosed generative AI use. The original source defines its scope.</span> </div> <p class="section-lede">A cooking roguelike dungeon crawler released on Oct 25, 2026, self-developed and self-published by Northern Studio LLC and filed under Action, Indie and RPG. The Steam AI disclosure is a bare list with no verb: Language Translation, Skill Icons, Dish Illustrations, Loading Illustrations. This site records translation and art as used on that list and the remaining six areas as areas the disclosure does not address. Because the list never says whether the named assets are all or part of the game, or how they were produced, every finding rests on the developer own statement and none of it has been independently audited.</p>  <div class="table-wrap"> <table class="ai-table"> <thead> <tr><th>Area</th><th>Scope</th><th>Status</th><th>Notes</th></tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>In-game generation</strong><small>In-game AI</small></td> <td class="muted">Content generated during play</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Code</strong><small>Code</small></td> <td class="muted">Programming and development</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Art</strong><small>Art</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Visual assets</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">Three of the four listed items are image work, skill icons, dish illustrations and loading illustrations, so art is recorded as used, while the list never says whether those cover all or only part of the artwork or how it was made.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Music &amp; sound</strong><small>Music &amp; SFX</small></td> <td class="muted">Music and sound</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Voice</strong><small>Voice</small></td> <td class="muted">Voice and dialogue audio</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Writing</strong><small>Writing</small></td> <td class="muted">Story and written content</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Translation</strong><small>Translation</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Translation and localization</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">The first listed item is Language Translation, recorded here as a translation use even though the list carries no verb or qualifier.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Marketing</strong><small>Marketing</small></td> <td class="muted">Promotional material</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="legend"> <span><i class="dot used"></i>Reported use (official / third-party)</span> <span><i class="dot not_stated"></i>Not stated (not proof of no use)</span> <span><i class="dot claimed_none"></i>Developer claims no AI</span> <span><i class="dot unreviewed"></i>Unreviewed</span> </div> <blockquote class="quote"> <p>“Language Translation, Skill Icons, Dish Illustrations, Loading Illustrations”</p> <footer>Steam 商店 AI 生成内容披露栏完整原文，2026-11-04 核查；可能随商店页更新。 · <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3401570/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read original ↗</a></footer> </blockquote> <details class="callout"> <summary><strong>How to interpret these statuses</strong></summary> <p>Reported AI use: 2/8. Developer no-use claims: 0/8. Claims are not independent verification; not stated does not mean no AI use.</p> </details> <p class="source-line"> Primary source:<a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3401570/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official disclosure ↗</a> <span> · Reviewed 2026-11-04</span> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="evidence"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE</div><h2>Evidence</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">3 sources</div> </div> <div class="timeline"> <article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Official disclosure</span> <time>2026-11-04</time> </div> <h3>Steam 商店完整 AI 披露</h3> <p>Language Translation, Skill Icons, Dish Illustrations, Loading Illustrations</p> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3401570/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Steam discussion index</span> <time>2026-11-04</time> </div> <h3>Steam 讨论区首页核查</h3> <p>英文讨论区首页显示 15 个主题（总数 48）；仅覆盖首页。</p> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/3401570/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Third-party source</span> <time>2026-11-04</time> </div> <h3>AI Transparency Index 该作条目（结构化数据逐字收录披露）</h3> <p>Language Translation, Skill Icons, Dish Illustrations, Loading Illustrations</p> <a href="https://aitransparencyindex.com/products/steam/3401570" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article> </div> <details class="callout"><summary><strong>Review notes (expand)</strong></summary><p>Checked the complete English Steam AI disclosure, the identity (Northern Studio LLC is both developer and publisher) and the English discussion homepage (15 visible topics of 48, first page only), where no topic matches the AI keyword search, so no thread needed reading. This title was searched once, that one response holds 6 results and 1 raw source was read: the AI Transparency Index entry transcribes this list verbatim and adds nothing beyond it. The other 5 results were an industry-site chart page of Steam AI disclosures, the coming-soon listing on genplay.gg, two pages of a third-party promotion and walkthrough site for this title (one about the demo, one about the release date) and the demo store page under App ID 4759840; none carries verifiable text from the released games disclosure, so none is registered as a source. This disclosure differs from the others in the batch: it holds keywords rather than sentences, so the scope, the share of assets and the production method are all unstated, which is why the unnamed areas are recorded as not addressed rather than as not used. The search scope is recorded in coverageLimits and no independent report was found, which is not proof that AI was not used.</p></details> </section> <section class="section" id="steam"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">STEAM DATA</div><h2>Steam data</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Public data snapshot</div> </div> <div class="stat-grid"> <div class="stat"> <span>Online now</span> <strong>55</strong> <small>Steam public API</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Steam reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>No data</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Positive reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>All languages</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Release date</span> <strong>2026</strong> <small>Oct 25, 2026</small> </div> </div> <div class="steam-desc"><h3>Steam description</h3><p>生存、烹饪、征服！在Roguelike中通过烹饪怪物挑战最深层。200+装备与随机地图，为你带来无限可能的全新体验。</p></div> <p class="source-line"> Player and review figures are Steam snapshots taken at build time and may be delayed. <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3401570/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View current data on Steam ↗</a> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="developer"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">DEVELOPER</div><h2>Developer</h2></div></div> <div class="dev-card"> <div class="dev-avatar">NO</div> <div class="dev-body"> <h3>Northern Studio LLC</h3> <p>Developer / publisher</p> <div class="dev-links"> <a href="https://abyssring.netlify.app/english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Website ↗</a> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/search/?developer=Northern%20Studio%20LLC" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Developer on Steam ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Abyss%20Ring%EF%BC%883401570%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F3401570-abyss-ring%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claim / correct ↗</a> </div> </div> </div>  </section> <section class="section" id="community"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</div><h2>Player impressions</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Separate from official disclosures</div> </div> <p class="section-lede">Player impressions are not evidence of AI use. Votes do not change developer disclosure findings.</p> <form id="voteForm" class="vote-form"> <select id="voteSelect" required aria-label="Choose your impression"> <option value="">Your impression…</option> <option value="no_ai_suspected">I suspect no AI use</option> <option value="some_ai_suspected">I suspect some AI use</option> <option value="heavy_ai_suspected">I suspect extensive AI use</option> <option value="all_ai_suspected">I suspect AI throughout</option> </select> <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Submit</button> </form> <p id="voteMessage" class="muted" role="status"></p> <div id="voteCounts" class="vote-counts"></div> <p class="source-line">Feedback availability does not affect the evidence. One vote per network per game.</p> </section> <section class="section" id="sources"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">SOURCES</div><h2>Sources &amp; review limits</h2></div></div> <ul class="source-list"> <li> <span>Official disclosure</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3401570/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 商店完整 AI 披露</a> <time>2026-11-04</time> </li><li> <span>Steam discussion index</span> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/3401570/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 讨论区首页核查</a> <time>2026-11-04</time> </li><li> <span>Third-party source</span> <a href="https://aitransparencyindex.com/products/steam/3401570" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AI Transparency Index 该作条目（结构化数据逐字收录披露）</a> <time>2026-11-04</time> </li> <li> <span>Steam store</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3401570/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Abyss Ring · App 3401570</a> <time></time> </li> </ul> <div class="callout"> <strong>Found an error?</strong> <p> Please include an original source, date and specific correction. <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Abyss%20Ring%EF%BC%883401570%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F3401570-abyss-ring%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Suggest a correction ↗</a> or <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Abyss%20Ring%20%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open a GitHub issue ↗</a>。
</p> </div> </section> <div class="share-bar"> <span>Share this game</span> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn2" type="button">Copy link</button> <a class="btn" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Does%20Abyss%20Ring%20use%20AI%3F&url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F3401570-abyss-ring%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Share on X</a> <a class="btn" href="https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F3401570-abyss-ring%2F&title=Abyss%20Ring%20%E2%80%94%20AI%20use%20evidence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Reddit</a> </div> </main> <div class="tf-cta-wrap"><a class="tf-cta" href="https://toolfavor.com/?utm_source=gameaichecker&utm_medium=footer_button" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3l1.9 4.6L18.5 9.5l-4.6 1.9L12 16l-1.9-4.6L5.5 9.5l4.6-1.9z"></path><path d="M19 15l.8 1.9 1.9.8-1.9.8L19 20.4l-.8-1.9-1.9-.8 1.9-.8z"></path></svg><span>Discover more useful tools on ToolFavor</span><svg class="tf-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="wrap"> <span>Game AI Checker · Independent of Valve / Steam.</span> <span>Evidence first · Not stated does not mean unused</span> </div> </footer> <dialog class="lightbox" id="lightbox"> <button id="closeLightbox" type="button" aria-label="Close">×</button> <img id="lightboxImg" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"> <div class="lightbox-caption" id="lightboxCaption"></div> </dialog> <script>
    (() => {
      const app = document.getElementById('app');
      const labels = JSON.parse(app?.dataset.ui || '{}');
      const tx = key => labels[key] || key;
      const en = document.documentElement.lang === 'en';
      const key = app?.dataset.gameKey || '';
      const slug = app?.dataset.slug || '';

      document.querySelectorAll('img[data-fallback]').forEach((img) => {
        const fallback = img.dataset.fallback;
        if (!fallback) return;
        img.addEventListener('error', function onError() {
          img.removeEventListener('error', onError);
          img.dataset.fallback = '';
          img.src = fallback;
          img.addEventListener('error', () => { img.style.display = 'none'; }, { once: true });
        });
      });

      const heroImg = document.getElementById('heroImg');
      const heroMedia = document.getElementById('heroMedia');
      const thumbs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.thumb'));
      const counter = document.getElementById('mediaCount');
      const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pauseBtn');
      let index = 0;
      let paused = false;
      let hovering = false;
      let timer = null;

      const warmedImages = new Set();
      function warm(full) {
        if (!full || warmedImages.has(full)) return null;
        warmedImages.add(full);
        const image = new Image();
        image.decoding = 'async';
        image.src = full;
        return image;
      }
      // Browse one frame ahead so the lightbox never waits on a cold round trip.
      function warmAround() {
        if (!thumbs.length) return;
        const upcoming = [thumbs[index], thumbs[(index + 1) % thumbs.length]];
        const run = () => upcoming.forEach((thumb) => thumb && warm(thumb.dataset.full));
        if (typeof window.requestIdleCallback === 'function') window.requestIdleCallback(run, { timeout: 1500 });
        else setTimeout(run, 500);
      }

      function show(next) {
        if (!heroImg || !thumbs.length) return;
        index = (next + thumbs.length) % thumbs.length;
        const thumb = thumbs[index];
        heroImg.src = thumb.dataset.src || heroImg.src;
        heroImg.dataset.full = thumb.dataset.full || heroImg.dataset.full;
        thumbs.forEach((item, position) => item.classList.toggle('active', position === index));
        if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
        warmAround();
      }

      function schedule() {
        clearInterval(timer);
        if (thumbs.length < 2 || paused || hovering || document.hidden) return;
        timer = setInterval(() => show(index + 1), 6000);
      }

      thumbs.forEach((thumb) => {
        thumb.addEventListener('click', () => {
          show(Number(thumb.dataset.index || 0));
          schedule();
        });
      });

      document.getElementById('prevBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index - 1); schedule(); });
      document.getElementById('nextBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index + 1); schedule(); });
      pauseBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        paused = !paused;
        pauseBtn.textContent = paused ? '▶' : 'Ⅱ';
        pauseBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', paused ? tx("继续轮播") : tx("暂停轮播"));
        schedule();
      });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => { hovering = true; schedule(); });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => { hovering = false; schedule(); });
      document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', schedule);
      schedule();

      const appId = app?.dataset.appid;
      if (appId && heroImg && !heroImg.getAttribute('src')?.startsWith('/images/steam/')) {
        fetch(`/api/steam-media?id=${encodeURIComponent(appId)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            if (!data?.available) return;
            for (const shot of data.screenshots || []) {
              const src = shot.thumbnail || shot.full;
              const full = shot.full || shot.thumbnail;
              if (!src || thumbs.some((thumb) => thumb.dataset.full === full)) continue;
              const thumb = document.createElement('button');
              thumb.className = 'thumb';
              thumb.type = 'button';
              thumb.dataset.src = src;
              thumb.dataset.full = full;
              thumb.dataset.index = String(thumbs.length);
              thumb.setAttribute('aria-label', `第 ${thumbs.length + 1} 张图片`);
              const image = document.createElement('img');
              image.src = src;
              image.alt = '';
              image.loading = 'lazy';
              image.decoding = 'async';
              thumb.append(image);
              thumb.addEventListener('click', () => { show(Number(thumb.dataset.index)); schedule(); });
              document.getElementById('thumbs')?.append(thumb);
              thumbs.push(thumb);
            }
            if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
            const countText = document.getElementById('mediaCountText');
            if (countText) countText.textContent = `${thumbs.length} ${en ? 'official images' : '张官方图片'}`;
            schedule();

            if (data.movies?.length) {
              const mediaCol = document.querySelector('.media-col');
              let videos = document.querySelector('.videos');
              if (!videos && mediaCol) {
                videos = document.createElement('div');
                videos.className = 'videos';
                videos.innerHTML = '<div class="mini-title"></div><div class="video-grid"></div>';
                videos.querySelector('.mini-title').textContent = tx('宣传视频');
                mediaCol.append(videos);
              }
              const grid = videos?.querySelector('.video-grid');
              if (grid) {
                const first = data.movies.find((movie) => movie.webm || movie.mp4);
                if (first) {
                  const player = document.createElement('video');
                  player.className = 'trailer';
                  player.controls = true;
                  player.preload = 'none';
                  player.poster = first.thumbnail || '';
                  player.src = first.webm || first.mp4;
                  grid.before(player);
                }
                for (const movie of data.movies.slice(0, 4)) {
                  if (!movie.thumbnail) continue;
                  const link = document.createElement('a');
                  link.className = 'video-card';
                  link.href = data.steamUrl || `https://store.steampowered.com/app/${appId}/`;
                  link.target = '_blank';
                  link.rel = 'noopener noreferrer';
                  const poster = document.createElement('img');
                  poster.src = movie.thumbnail;
                  poster.alt = movie.name || tx("宣传视频");
                  poster.loading = 'lazy';
                  const label = document.createElement('span');
                  label.textContent = `${movie.name || tx("观看宣传视频")} ↗`;
                  link.append(poster, label);
                  grid.append(link);
                }
              }
            }
          })
          .catch(() => {});
      }

      const lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');
      const lightboxImg = document.getElementById('lightboxImg');
      const lightboxCaption = document.getElementById('lightboxCaption');
      function openLightbox() {
        if (!heroImg || !lightbox || !lightboxImg) return;
        const full = heroImg.dataset.full || heroImg.src;
        // The 1280 hero frame is already decoded, so the dialog shows at once and upgrades in place.
        lightboxImg.src = heroImg.currentSrc || heroImg.src;
        lightboxImg.alt = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (lightboxCaption) lightboxCaption.textContent = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (typeof lightbox.showModal === 'function') lightbox.showModal();
        const larger = warm(full);
        if (larger) larger.onload = () => { lightboxImg.src = larger.src; };
      }
      document.getElementById('openLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      heroImg?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      [document.getElementById('openLightbox'), heroMedia].forEach((node) => node?.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => warm(heroImg?.dataset.full), { once: true }));
      document.getElementById('closeLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', () => lightbox?.close());
      lightbox?.addEventListener('click', (event) => { if (event.target === lightbox) lightbox.close(); });

      const saveBtn = document.getElementById('saveBtn');
      const starKey = `gac:star:${slug}`;
      function paintStar() {
        if (!saveBtn) return;
        const active = localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1';
        saveBtn.textContent = active ? tx("★ 已收藏") : tx("☆ 收藏");
        saveBtn.classList.toggle('active', active);
      }
      saveBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1') localStorage.removeItem(starKey);
        else localStorage.setItem(starKey, '1');
        paintStar();
      });
      paintStar();

      async function copyLink() {
        const url = window.location.href;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(url);
          flash(tx("链接已复制"));
        } catch {
          window.prompt(tx("复制链接"), url);
        }
      }
      function flash(message) {
        const target = document.getElementById('voteMessage') || document.getElementById('shareBtn');
        if (!target) return;
        const original = target.textContent;
        if (target.id === 'voteMessage') {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = original; }, 2200);
        } else {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = tx("分享"); }, 2200);
        }
      }
      async function share() {
        if (navigator.share) {
          try {
            await navigator.share({ title: document.title, url: window.location.href });
            return;
          } catch {}
        }
        copyLink();
      }
      document.getElementById('shareBtn')?.addEventListener('click', share);
      document.getElementById('shareBtn2')?.addEventListener('click', copyLink);

      document.getElementById('copyId')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        const id = app?.dataset.appid;
        if (!id) return;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(id);
          flash(tx("App ID 已复制"));
        } catch {}
      });

      const voteForm = document.getElementById('voteForm');
      const voteMessage = document.getElementById('voteMessage');
      const voteCounts = document.getElementById('voteCounts');
      const voteSelect = document.getElementById('voteSelect');
      const voteNames = {
        no_ai_suspected: tx("认为没有使用 AI"),
        some_ai_suspected: tx("认为部分使用 AI"),
        heavy_ai_suspected: tx("认为大量使用 AI"),
        all_ai_suspected: tx("认为几乎全程使用 AI"),
      };
      function showCounts(counts) {
        if (!voteCounts) return;
        voteCounts.replaceChildren();
        for (const [code, label] of Object.entries(voteNames)) {
          const value = Number(counts?.[code] || 0);
          if (!value) continue;
          const row = document.createElement('div');
          row.textContent = en ? `${value} players ${label}` : `${value} 位玩家${label}`;
          voteCounts.append(row);
        }
      }
      if (voteForm && key) {
        fetch(`/api/feedback?game=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            showCounts(data.counts);
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈功能已启用。");
          })
          .catch(() => {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("匿名反馈暂未启用，等待管理员配置数据库。");
          });
        voteForm.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
          event.preventDefault();
          const vote = voteSelect?.value;
          if (!vote) return;
          const button = voteForm.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
          if (button) button.disabled = true;
          try {
            const response = await fetch('/api/feedback', {
              method: 'POST',
              headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
              body: JSON.stringify({ game: key, vote }),
            });
            const data = await response.json();
            if (!response.ok) {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = response.status === 409 ? tx("该网络已对本游戏投过票。") : tx("提交失败，请稍后再试。");
              if (data.counts) showCounts(data.counts);
            } else {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈已记录，谢谢参与。");
              showCounts(data.counts);
              voteForm.reset();
            }
          } catch {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("网络错误，请稍后重试。");
          } finally {
            if (button) button.disabled = false;
          }
        });
      }

      const navLinks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.section-nav a'));
      if (navLinks.length && 'IntersectionObserver' in window) {
        const linksById = new Map(navLinks.map((link) => [link.getAttribute('href')?.slice(1), link]));
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          for (const entry of entries) {
            if (!entry.isIntersecting) continue;
            navLinks.forEach((link) => link.classList.remove('active'));
            linksById.get(entry.target.id)?.classList.add('active');
          }
        }, { rootMargin: '-35% 0px -55% 0px' });
        document.querySelectorAll('section[id]').forEach((section) => observer.observe(section));
      }
    })();
  </script> <script>
    document.getElementById('game-language')?.addEventListener('change', (event) => {
      const slug = document.getElementById('app')?.dataset.slug;
      if (slug) window.location.assign('/games/' + (event.target.value === 'en' ? '' : event.target.value + '/') + encodeURIComponent(slug) + '/' + location.hash);
    });
  </script> </body> </html>